# Shell scripts and the cluster requirements file MUST keep LF endings. A clone
# with core.autocrlf=true otherwise checks them out with CRLF, and `git archive`
# carries that into the zip uploaded to the Altair portal -- where bash reads
# `set -uo pipefail<CR>` and dies with "set: pipefail: invalid option name",
# taking the whole phase with it.
*.sh text eol=lf
requirements*.txt text eol=lf
